# --- English ---
title@en = Operation 8: Night Raid
brief@en = Having lost the skies, the enemy has stopped moving by day and moves only at night.
brief@en = So we go out at night too. This operation is night from start to finish.
brief@en = Vision is short at night. The open plain in the middle leaves you exposed.
brief@en = Go around through the forests on both flanks, and find them before they find you.
brief@en = Send recon units ahead, and keep seeing farther than the enemy does.
story@en = Staff Officer Werner|The enemy stopped moving by day. Because we took the skies.
story@en = Lt. Mira|So we go out at night as well?
story@en = Staff Officer Werner|Yes. No one sees well at night. Whoever spots the other first wins.
story@en = Lt. Mira|...I'll strengthen our recon. No lights allowed.
story_win@en = Lt. Mira|Enemy position taken. They never managed to spot us.
story_win@en = Staff Officer Werner|The night is no longer on their side.
sub_desc@en = Win within 24 turns
sub_desc@en = Win losing no more than 3 units
sub_desc@en = Keep at least 2 recon units alive
event_msg@en = The enemy night watch is on the move!

[node M11]
art   = gfx/brief/m11.png
reward = gfx/reward/m11.png
title = 第9作戦「共同戦線」
map   = maps/c15_alliance.map
brief = 南方連合が参戦した。東方連邦も北方同盟を引き入れ、戦線は2対2になる。
brief = 援軍（南方連合）は友軍だ。撃てないし、向こうも撃ってこない。
brief = 援軍の拠点は占領できないが、援軍が見つけた敵はこちらにも見える。
brief = 工兵を回す。隣接ヘクスの拠点を壊せば、敵の収入と補給を断てる。
brief = （東方連邦の首都を落とせば勝ち。北方同盟が健在でも決着する）
brief = （自軍だけで拠点14個を確保しても勝利となる。援軍の分は数えない）
# --- 幕間（story = 話者|セリフ。話者空で地の文） ---
story = 南方連合が参戦した。長い中立の末の決断だった。
story = ミラ少尉|友軍です。撃てませんし、向こうも撃ってきません。
story = ヴェルナー参謀|頼りにするな。あの国は自国の利のために動く。
story = ミラ少尉|……とはいえ、東からの圧力が減るのは助かります。
# --- 勝利直後の幕間 ---
story_win = ミラ少尉|共同戦線、勝利です。南方連合にも損害は出ましたが。
story_win = ヴェルナー参謀|……礼は言っておけ。次も同じ側にいるとは限らん。
next_win  = M08
next_lose = LOSE
carry  = 1
bonus  = 800
enemy    = NORMAL
enemy_co = BALT   # 東方連邦の主力。攻めてくる
ctrl2 = NORMAL
co2   = HERTA     # 南方連合（友軍）は資金型で地味に粘る
ctrl3 = EASY
co3   = GRAF      # 北方同盟（敵の援軍）は守勢。攻めると硬い
