# --- English ---
title@en = Operation 9: Joint Front
brief@en = The Southern Union has joined the war. The Federation brought in the Northern Pact: 2 vs 2.
brief@en = The Southern Union is an ally. You can't fire on them, and they won't fire on you.
brief@en = You can't capture allied bases, but enemies the allies spot are visible to you too.
brief@en = Engineers are coming. Demolish bases on adjacent hexes to cut enemy income and supply.
brief@en = (Take the Eastern Federation capital to win, even if the Northern Pact still stands.)
brief@en = (Holding 14 bases with your own forces also wins. Allied bases don't count.)
story@en = The Southern Union entered the war, after a long neutrality.
story@en = Lt. Mira|They're allies. We can't fire on them, and they won't fire on us.
story@en = Staff Officer Werner|Don't rely on them. That nation acts in its own interest.
story@en = Lt. Mira|...Still, less pressure from the east is welcome.
story_win@en = Lt. Mira|Victory on the joint front. The Southern Union took losses too.
story_win@en = Staff Officer Werner|...Thank them. They may not be on our side next time.
sub_desc@en = Win within 30 turns
sub_desc@en = Win losing no more than 6 units
event_msg@en = Engineers arrived: demolish or restore adjacent terrain.
event_msg@en = The Southern Union attacks in the east. Push from the west!
event_msg@en = The Northern Pact has sent in heavy tanks!

[node M08]
art   = gfx/brief/m08.png
reward = gfx/reward/m08.png
title = 第10作戦「補給都市の攻防」
map   = maps/c09_cities.map
brief = 敵首都圏への最後の補給結節点。中央の都市群を制圧すれば
