# --- English ---
title@en = Operation 10: Battle for the Supply Cities
brief@en = The last supply hub before the enemy capital region. Take the cities in the center
brief@en = and our ability to keep fighting will rise sharply.
brief@en = Rush infantry in by truck and seize the cities quickly.
brief@en = (Hold 16 bases to win without taking the enemy capital.)
story@en = Staff Officer Werner|Supplies to the enemy capital pass through these cities.
story@en = Lt. Mira|Take them and their production will dwindle.
story@en = Lt. Mira|Which also means they'll defend them desperately.
story_win@en = Lt. Mira|Supply cities taken. Enemy production is visibly falling.
story_win@en = Staff Officer Werner|The squeeze is working. But a starving army always lunges forward.
sub_desc@en = Hold at least 12 bases, including cities
sub_desc@en = Win losing no more than 6 units
event_msg@en = Stripped of its cities, the enemy counterattacks in force!

[node N1]
