# --- English ---
title@en = Operation 11: Command of the Sea
brief@en = The enemy capital lies on a fortress island to the east. First we must win the seas around it.
brief@en = Destroy the enemy fleet with battleships and cruisers, and win the air with carrier aircraft.
brief@en = Once the sea is ours, ferry landing forces to the island and take the command post.
brief@en = Bring supply ships along to keep the front-line ships supplied at sea.
story@en = The sea is open. Neither fleet has sighted the other yet.
story@en = Lt. Mira|We need command of the sea. Every operation from here starts on the water.
story_win@en = The enemy ships vanished from the chart.
story_win@en = Lt. Mira|Command of the sea secured. The sea lanes are open to us now.
sub_desc@en = Keep at least 1 battleship alive
sub_desc@en = Destroy at least 10 enemy fleet units
event_msg@en = The enemy main fleet has sortied!

