# --- English ---
title@en = Operation 16: Landing at the Enemy Capital
brief@en = The enemy capital faces the eastern sea. Launch the largest landing in history from the west.
brief@en = Pound the shore defenses with naval guns and carrier aircraft, then land troops from transports.
brief@en = The enemy is dug in with coastal guns, AA, and armor. Clear coastal ships with escort destroyers,
brief@en = build a bridgehead, then advance on the enemy command post inland.
story@en = For the first time, Western flags turned toward the enemy's own coast.
story@en = Lt. Mira|Landing now. From here on, it's their soil.
story@en = Staff Officer Werner|Carefully. A cornered beast is the most dangerous.
story_win@en = A Western flag stands on the enemy's home shore.
story_win@en = Lt. Mira|The landing succeeded. ...We made it this far, Commander.
sub_desc@en = Keep at least 1 transport ship alive and build a bridgehead
sub_desc@en = Land successfully within 50 turns
event_msg@en = The shoreline defenders have deployed!

[node M14]
art   = gfx/brief/m14.png
reward = gfx/reward/m14.png
title = 第13作戦「後退線」
map   = maps/c18_withdraw.map
brief = 平原での勝利で前に出すぎた。側面に敵の機甲師団が現れている。
brief = **この作戦に「敵を全滅させる」勝利は無い。16ターン持ちこたえれば勝ちだ。**
brief = 中央の谷は狭く守りやすいが、南北に迂回路がある。放置すれば背後を取られる。
brief = 対戦車部隊と自走砲で隘路を塞げ。都市は手放してもいい。線を保て。
# --- 幕間（story = 話者|セリフ。話者空で地の文） ---
