# --- English ---
title@en = Operation 13: Fallback Line
brief@en = Our victory on the plains carried us too far. Enemy armor has appeared on our flank.
brief@en = **There is no "destroy all enemies" victory here. Hold out for 16 turns and you win.**
brief@en = The central valley is narrow and easy to hold, but there are detours to the north and south.
brief@en = Leave them unguarded and the enemy will get behind you.
brief@en = Block the passes with anti-tank units and SP guns. You can give up the cities. Hold the line.
story@en = Lt. Mira|Commander, enemy armor on our flank. ...We advanced too fast.
story@en = Staff Officer Werner|Fall back before we're surrounded. All units, to the fallback line.
story@en = Lt. Mira|Fall back? After pushing them this far?
story@en = Staff Officer Werner|Those who try to hold everything lose everything. Hold the line.
story_win@en = Lt. Mira|The enemy pursuit has stopped. We're holding the fallback line.
story_win@en = Staff Officer Werner|Lost towns can be retaken. The division is still alive.
sub_desc@en = Hold out losing no more than 4 units
sub_desc@en = Hold out with at least 2 anti-tank units left
sub_desc@en = Hold out with at least 4 bases
event_msg@en = Enemy light tanks swung around the north detour!
event_msg@en = Enemy mech infantry emerged from the south pass too!

[node M12]
art   = gfx/brief/m12.png
reward = gfx/reward/m12.png
title = 第14作戦「三つ巴の要衝」
map   = maps/c16_threeway.map
brief = 共同戦線を離れた南方連合が、要衝の丘に独自に陣取った。
brief = こちらにも彼らにも味方はいない。三勢力の乱戦だ。
brief = 二正面にならないよう、両軍がぶつかるのを待つのも手だ。
brief = （拠点17個を確保すれば、両軍を潰さなくても勝利となる）
# --- 幕間（story = 話者|セリフ。話者空で地の文） ---
story = 南方連合が、要衝の丘に独自に陣取った。
story = ミラ少尉|共同戦線は終わりだそうです。理由は聞けませんでした。
story = ヴェルナー参謀|言っただろう。あの国は自国の利で動く。
story = ミラ少尉|三つ巴です。両軍がぶつかるのを待つ手もありますが。
